The Molgian Bureau economy is based on '''Molgium'''.

== Currency Sources ==
* <code>/work</code> daily salary
* Fishing catches sold via <code>/fish sell</code>
* Gambling wins
* Event rewards
* Admin grants (staff only)

== Daily Work ==
* Command: <code>/work</code>
* Reset: '''06:00 Europe/Oslo'''
* Once per reset window
* 1% robbery chance can cancel the day’s work payout

== Job Progression ==
Use:
* <code>/job list</code>
* <code>/job apply id:&lt;n&gt;</code>

Jobs are applied in order and permanently raise SalaryBase.

{| class="wikitable"
! Job ID !! Apply Cost !! New SalaryBase
|-
| 1 || 10000 Molgium || 250
|-
| 2 || 30000 Molgium || 500
|-
| 3 || 75000 Molgium || 900
|}

== Economy Rules ==
* No negative balances
* No trading system in launch era
* Treasury supports event payouts and tax flows
* High jackpot payouts may trigger tax into Treasury

